      "side": 1,
      "message": "Clear `diff_page_sidebar` user preference when opening the chat panel replaces an active plugin sidebar.\n\nWhen switching from the chat panel to a plugin sidebar, `onTrigger` in `renderSidebarTriggers()` resets `chatPanelOpen` to `false` and updates `diff_page_sidebar` to `plugin-${pluginName}`. However, in the reverse direction—when a plugin sidebar is open (`this.shownSidebar` is a plugin name) and the user opens Agent Chat—`diff_page_sidebar` remains set to `plugin-${pluginName}` in `userModel.preferences$`. If the user subsequently closes the chat panel and navigates away and back to the cached `\u003cgr-diff-view\u003e`, `connectedCallback()` re-reads `preferences$` and unexpectedly reopens the previously replaced plugin sidebar.\n\n```suggestion\n    subscribe(\n      this,\n      () \u003d\u003e this.getChatModel().chatPanelOpen$,\n      open \u003d\u003e {\n        if (open) {\n          if (\n            this.shownSidebar !\u003d\u003d undefined \u0026\u0026\n            this.shownSidebar !\u003d\u003d CHAT_PANEL_SIDEBAR\n          ) {\n            this.getUserModel().updatePreferences({\n              diff_page_sidebar: \u0027NONE\u0027,\n            });\n          }\n          this.shownSidebar \u003d CHAT_PANEL_SIDEBAR;\n        } else if (this.shownSidebar \u003d\u003d\u003d CHAT_PANEL_SIDEBAR) {\n          this.shownSidebar \u003d undefined;\n        }\n      }\n    );\n```",
